<table style="margin: auto; width: 100%;  background-color: #ffffff;  border-radius: 5px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 10px 30px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px;">
      Hello {{userAddrShort}},
      <br><br>
      A swap order you are involved in was marked as <b>PAID</b> by the counterparty.
      Kindly verify payment and release the locked asset to complete the order.
      <br><br>
      <div class="alert" {{> alertStyle }}>
        <div style="padding: 5px 10px;">{{> badgeDanger label='DANGER' }}  Please verify the payment with your financial service provider before you release.</div>
        <div style="padding: 5px 10px; border-top: 1px dashed #f7f7f7; font-weight: bold;">This order can be appealed in <span style="color: #707073;">{{disputeFrom}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <br>
      {{> primaryButton this }}
      <br>
      Love, <br>
      {{app}} Team
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>


